    {
      "id": "skill",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "path": "skills/transfer-generation/SKILL.md",
      "anchor": "## 核心流程",
      "commit": "ee6450e371dbb355c045c987b22500fd9f3bbc3a",
      "sha256": "4e9577973959484cbd5f8eff329476b695e787c2b1cef31538a5784f8cf9ffd0",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "事实获取、澄清、确切配置复核与创建；分别确认行粒度和字段范围，草稿检查不进入创建复核。固定卡片承担同参事实概要、映射和参数，Skill 只指导关键检查解释，不生成第二份概要、重建历史映射或混淆定义保存与目标建表；修改仍须重新预检和复核",
        "en": "Fact discovery, clarification, exact review and creation with separate row grain and fields; draft checks do not approve creation. Fixed cards own same-argument facts, mappings and parameters; Skill guides key explanations without duplicate summaries, reconstructed mappings or confusing saved definitions with table creation; changes require fresh checks and review"
      }
    },
    {
