      "sha256": "e7304671a257627592aeea3112ceb8352ea45725ae340ed0995410c807309d80",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "最终复核和创建前经正式 Adapter 自动预检；拒绝反馈 owner 诊断供修正，服务失败清旧报告并终止；有效检查生成去身份只读投影。Runtime 明确固定卡片承担已预检事实概要，关键解释引用 Skill，完整诊断保留；不增加另一套领域方法、条件或授权",
        "en": "Formal Adapter checks before review and creation; refusals return owner diagnostics and service failures clear stale reports and stop; valid checks yield identity-free read-only projections. Runtime delegates checked fact summaries to fixed cards and key explanation guidance to Skill, retaining full diagnostics without duplicate domain methods, conditions or authorization"
      }
    },
    {
