        "en": "Real Harness, Manifest and SDK verify informed confirmation, request binding, stable changes, rejection feedback, fresh checks and zero effects on failure or cancellation; controlled calls load production Skill composition and retain concise guidance and full diagnostics for all states, fixed projections and array fields; errors produce no card and tests do not prove free-model concision"
      }
    },
