    {
      "id": "transfer.task.create",
      "state": "modeled",
      "summary": {
        "zh-cn": "只建未启动的 native table 有界快照任务，目标仅 replace/append；复核和创建前正式只读预检，unsupported 阻止创建，unknown 明示限制后知情确认；不保证实际值转换或执行成功，不是 Transfer 全功能声明",
        "en": "Create only a stopped native table bounded snapshot task with replace/append; formal read-only checks precede review and creation, unsupported blocks creation and unknown requires informed confirmation; no guarantee of value conversion, execution success or full Transfer coverage"
      },
      "sources": [
        "manifest",
        "handler",
        "owner_test",
        "policy_spec",
        "planner", "conditions", "condition_test", "skill"
